{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act53side", "eventName": "直到大地变成一颗酸橙", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TO-4", "avgTag": "行动后", "storyName": "谷里升起太阳", "storyInfo": "仍在向太阳谷工业争取维修机会的阿梅利亚和嘉辛塔突然收到了安洁莉娜带来的紧急消息——单独下井找人的塔妮遭遇了突发事件，急需帮助！", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g5_sunvalleycom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$farce_n_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸？下井了？可这几天不是没有采掘任务吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2"}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就是因为没有采掘任务才得她下井啊。她下的不是矿井，是我们内部通讯系统使用的管线井。", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "前一阵子我们都改用纵贯红土公司的无线系统了，结果大断连一来，又得把旧设备从仓库里搬出来。", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "旧系统已经好多年了，一段时间不用之后全是毛病，她就是下井解决那些陈年老毛病去了。", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那您能告诉我她是从哪里下去，又要去哪里吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可以是可以，但你下过矿吗？", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我叔叔巴尼特就在矿井工作，我小时候他带我下去过几次。我只是找个人而已，不会多逗留的......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......您要来颗胡萝卜糖吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "噗，你这小姑娘，当我多大，要用糖收买我？", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2", "posfrom": "-200,0", "posto": "-70,0", "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.2}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿嘿......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2", "posfrom": "-70,0", "posto": "-200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......啧啧，这胡萝卜糖口味真不错。", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "反正那个维修员也没下多深，就是里面的路不好认，我七八岁的时候就天天往里钻了。", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看见那边的入口了吗？这个图上画红叉的地方就是她检修的位置。记得快进快出。", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "顺便，这对讲机你也拿着，是用旧的内部通讯系统的。", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我自己有通讯装置——", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就连纵贯红土公司的设备也得为太阳谷特地做信号增强，你们自己的通讯装置在井下不顶用的。", "name": "悠闲的矿工"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#17$2"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "谢谢你！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "46_g6_rmbtmine", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1, "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$3", "posfrom": "80,0", "posto": "80,0"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes"